{
  "title": "門終於開了",
  "title_en": "The Door Finally Opens",
  "series": "神話未完成",
  "series_en": "Myths in the Making",
  "volume": 27,
  "model": "史旺姬",
  "creator": "史旺基 Swanky",
  "slug": "swanky-ji-the-door-finally-opens",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "count": 36,
  "cover_photo": 4,
  "setting": "紅色高門前的石柱廊",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "門很高，她先用力推。停下來之後，目光落到腳邊：轉軸、輪子，一塊小木楔。她坐一會兒，換個方向，再試一次。等到自己可以通過，她也看見了後面的人。",
  "lead_en": "The door is tall. At first, she pushes harder. After she stops, her attention moves to the ground: a pivot, a wheel, a small wooden wedge. She sits for a while, changes her approach, and tries again. When she can pass through, she notices someone behind her.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "門很高，她先用力推。停下來之後，目光落到腳邊：轉軸、輪子，一塊小木楔。她坐一會兒，換個方向，再試一次。等到自己可以通過，她也看見了後面的人。\n\n有時需要推開，\n有時需要拿起腳邊的小東西。\n走過去之後，\n她把門留給下一個人。",
  "statement_en": "The door is tall. At first, she pushes harder. After she stops, her attention moves to the ground: a pivot, a wheel, a small wooden wedge. She sits for a while, changes her approach, and tries again. When she can pass through, she notices someone behind her.\n\nSometimes she pushes.\nSometimes she lifts a small thing from the ground.\nAfter crossing,\nshe leaves the door for the next person.",
  "afterword": "有時需要推開，\n有時需要拿起腳邊的小東西。\n走過去之後，\n她把門留給下一個人。",
  "afterword_en": "Sometimes she pushes.\nSometimes she lifts a small thing from the ground.\nAfter crossing,\nshe leaves the door for the next person.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
